#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates the use of UTM (Universal Transverse Mercator) coordinates. UTM coordinates divide the world into 60 zones, which are individual Mercator projections. Positions in each zone are given as an x,y coordinate in units of meters. By turning on the calculation of UTM coordinates (OPT_USE_UTM = 1) the trajectory of the vehicle can be plotted in a new coordinate system.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

